{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_10","type":"agent_message","text":"I saved the plan in both formats:\n\n- [plan.csv](/private/tmp/mp-q4UzmU/plan.csv) — nine filled cells in a 3×3 grid, ready to import into Google Sheets.\n- [plan.md](/private/tmp/mp-q4UzmU/plan.md) — the same plan in a readable layout.\n\nThe plan treats a **paid monthly class booking** as the sale, with staying into month three as the retention goal. It assumes Wednesday opens once four students have paid for its first month. I verified that the CSV has all nine cells in Before / During / After order."}}
